WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.760
<v Narrator><i>At dusk Polyphemus returns carrying a massive load of wood and drives his flock inside.</i>

2
00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:23.250
<v Narrator><i>Polyphemus lifts a stone slab that no ordinary team could move and blocks the entrance.</i>

3
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:35.220
<v Narrator><i>Polyphemus milks ewes and goats, sets young beneath mothers, curdles milk, and lights a fire.</i>

4
00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:42.030
<v Narrator><i>The hidden men and the giant demands their identity.</i>
